nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1634683852721" data-id="1634683852721" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1643073988458" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1643073988458" data-resolution="3000x3000" data-atomgroup="module"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/67570698-0f6e-4796-894a-426d135c9b6c/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/image%20100.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" natural-width="579" natural-height="352" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" width="579" height="352"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1643074435678" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1643074435678" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1643074435666" data-id="1643074435666"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1643074458207" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1643074458207" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/bbdf6a42-3a07-4b56-8342-f0df4b6da65b/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/kapok_comparison_image.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="90%" data-height="auto" title="" width="2000" height="1216" natural-width="2000" natural-height="1216"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1643074474695" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="16430744